---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面走丢了 | 日常AI"
  description="抱歉，你要找的页面不存在。欢迎返回《日常AI》生活实验室主页。"
  lang="zh"
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-16 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#D97757] text-[#FAF8F5] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
      <span>ERROR 404</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-black text-[#1E1E1E] tracking-tight mb-4 font-mono">
      404
    </h1>

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1E1E1E] mb-4">
      哎呀，这个生活实验好像跑丢了
    </h2>

    <p class="text-base text-[#5C5852] max-w-md mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      你访问的地址可能已迁移，或者网址输入有误。不过别担心，柴米油盐的生活还在继续，实验室随时欢迎你。
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="bg-[#1E1E1E] hover:bg-[#333333] text-[#FAF8F5] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#D97757]"
      >
        ← 返回实验大厅主页
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="border-2 border-[#1E1E1E] hover:bg-[#EFECE6] text-[#1E1E1E] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all"
      >
        关于《日常AI》
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#E8E2D8] grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
      <a href="/category/life-labs" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D9D3C7] hover:border-[#D97757]">
        🧪 生活实验
      </a>
      <a href="/category/workflows" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D9D3C7] hover:border-[#D97757]">
        ⚡ 日常工作流
      </a>
      <a href="/category/habit-shifts" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D9D3C7] hover:border-[#D97757]">
        🧠 习惯进化
      </a>
      <a href="/category/my-stack" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D9D3C7] hover:border-[#D97757]">
        🧰 实用工具箱
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
